      ":question/id": "7255336f-541a-5d86-a741-f2dca80083e1",
      ":question/problem": "Consider the matrix $A=\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & -1 \\\\ 0 & -3\\end{bmatrix}.$ Find ${A}^{2}.$\n\n<table align=\"l\" cellpadding=\"0\" rules=\"all\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"30px\" rowspan=\"2\">${A}^{2}=\\,\\,$</td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"30px\" width=\"5px\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\">\n{{field-1}}\n</td>\n<td align=\"center\">\n{{field-2}}\n</td>\n<td align=\"center\" width=\"5px\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\">\n{{field-3}}\n</td>\n<td align=\"center\" width=\"30px\">\n{{field-4}}\n</td>\n<td align=\"center\"></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
      ":question/worked-solution": "To find ${A}^{2},$ we multiply $A$ by itself:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{A}^{2} & =A\\cdot A \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & -1 \\\\ 0 & -3\\end{bmatrix}\\cdot \\begin{bmatrix}-1 & -1 \\\\ 0 & -3\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 4 \\\\ 0 & 9\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$",
      ":question/difficulty": ":question.difficulty/easy",
